<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{account.username}} · Kestrel Studio</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/main.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32">
      <span class="brand-name">Kestrel Studio</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="menu">
      <a class="menu-button" href="/">返回对话</a>
      <a class="menu-button" href="/admin">账号管理</a>
      <a class="menu-button" href="/admin/conversations">全站会话</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="account">
      <div class="account-menu">
        <span class="account-name">{{user.username}}</span>
        <form action="/logout" method="post" class="logout-form">
          <button type="submit" class="logout-button">退出登录</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="admin-main">
    {{#if notice}}
      <p class="admin-notice{{#if notice.isError}} admin-notice-error{{/if}}">{{notice.text}}</p>
    {{/if}}

    <section class="admin-card">
      <h2 class="admin-title">{{account.username}}</h2>
      <dl class="admin-facts">
        <dt>角色</dt><dd>{{account.roleLabel}}</dd>
        <dt>会话</dt><dd><a href="/admin/conversations?user={{account.id}}">{{account.conversationCount}} 个</a></dd>
        <dt>资产</dt><dd>{{account.assetCount}} 个</dd>
        <dt>创建时间</dt><dd>{{account.createdAtLabel}}</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-card">
      <h2 class="admin-title">重置密码</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">账号名只作显示，实际按本页地址里的账号重置。</p>
      {{! The account name is a real, visible field on purpose: Chrome warns about a
          password box with no visible username next to it, and password managers
          need the pairing to know whose password this is. Its value is not what
          identifies the account — the id in the form action does. }}
      <form class="admin-form" action="/admin/users/{{account.id}}/password" method="post">
        <label class="admin-field">
          <span>账号</span>
          <input name="username" type="text" value="{{account.username}}" readonly autocomplete="username">
        </label>
        <label class="admin-field">
          <span>新密码</span>
          <input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password">
        </label>
        <button type="submit" class="admin-button">重置密码</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-card admin-card-danger">
      <h2 class="admin-title">删除账号</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">
        将一并删除该账号名下 {{account.conversationCount}} 个会话、{{account.assetCount}} 个资产文件，
        以及这些会话的全部消息与任务记录。此操作不可撤销。
      </p>
      <a class="admin-button admin-button-danger" href="/admin/users/{{account.id}}/delete">删除账号</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
